{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>In your valuation as a guilt-offering.</b> In the valuation stated above." "<b>Wherein he sinned unwittingly and he did not know.</b> This teaches: if he knew after a time, he is not absolved by this asham until he brings a chatat. What is this like? Like the eglah arufah that was decapitated and afterward the killer was found — he is put to death (there)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:04.515142908Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}